<title>USA: Primedex exploring alternatives.</title>
<headline>Primedex exploring alternatives.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Primedex Health Systems Inc, said tuesday its board of directors had determined that the changing nature and consolidation of the healthcare market required that the company now explore various options.</p>
<p>In a statement, the company said the options include the seeking of a strategic partner or relationship to assure the company's position and growth in a changing environment.</p>
</text>
